#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2768
msgid "Validate Data Indexes"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2769
msgid ""
"Checks chat history, artifact, notebook, and pinned indexes for stale "
"entries (books that were moved or deleted outside KOReader) and fixes count "
"mismatches.\n"
"\n"
"This runs automatically for individual entries when browsing, but you can "
"run a full validation here if needed."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2776
msgid "Rebuild Data Indexes"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2777
msgid ""
"Finds books whose KOAssistant data (artifacts, chats, notebooks, pinned) "
"exists on disk but doesn't show in this device's browsers, e.g. after "
"syncing sidecar files from another device, restoring a backup, or migrating "
"devices.\n"
"\n"
"Checks your reading history, KOReader's sidecar locations, and the scan "
"folders configured below, then removes stale entries. Books on unmounted "
"storage get pruned; run again with the storage mounted to re-add them.\n"
"\n"
"May take a while on large libraries."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2788
msgid "Index Scan Folders: None"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2790
msgid "Index Scan Folders: %1"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2793
msgid ""
"Folders to scan during index rebuild: point this at your synced book "
"folders. Only these folders are ever scanned: by a rebuild, and by a backup "
"or restore point gathering per-book settings. Folders that don't exist on "
"this device are skipped.\n"
"\n"
"Note: a settings reset clears this list."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2799
msgid "Auto-Rebuild on Startup"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2802
msgid ""
"Also run the index rebuild automatically after KOReader starts: at most once "
"per day, only when scan folders are configured, quietly in the background."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2809
msgid "Reset Settings..."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2815
msgid "Quick: Settings only"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2816
msgid ""
"Resets ALL settings in this menu to defaults:\n"
"• Provider, model, temperature\n"
"• Streaming, display, export settings\n"
"• Dictionary & translation settings\n"
"• Reasoning & debug settings\n"
"\n"
"Keeps: API keys, your languages and selections (behavior, domain, trusted "
"providers, X-Ray defaults, favorite models, toolbar buttons, export folder), "
"all actions, custom behaviors/domains, custom providers/models, gesture "
"registrations, chat history."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2818
msgid ""
"Reset all settings to defaults?\n"
"\n"
"Resets ALL settings in Settings menu:\n"
"• Provider, model, temperature\n"
"• Streaming, display, export settings\n"
"• Dictionary & translation settings\n"
"• Reasoning & debug settings\n"
"\n"
"Keeps: API keys, your languages and selections (behavior, domain, trusted "
"providers, X-Ray defaults, favorite models, toolbar buttons, export folder), "
"all actions, custom behaviors/domains, custom providers/models, gesture "
"registrations, chat history."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2825
msgid "Quick: Actions only"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2826
msgid ""
"Resets all action-related settings:\n"
"• Custom actions you created\n"
"• Edits to built-in actions\n"
"• Disabled actions (re-enables all)\n"
"• All action menus (highlight, dictionary, quick actions, input dialogs, "
"general, file browser), the QA Panel Utilities and the QS Panel Items\n"
"\n"
"Keeps: All settings, API keys, custom behaviors/domains, custom providers/"
"models, gesture registrations, chat history."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2828
msgid ""
"Reset all action settings?\n"
"\n"
"Resets:\n"
"• Custom actions you created\n"
"• Edits to built-in actions\n"
"• Disabled actions (re-enables all)\n"
"• All action menus (highlight, dictionary, quick actions, input dialogs, "
"general, file browser), the QA Panel Utilities and the QS Panel Items\n"
"\n"
"Keeps: All settings, API keys, custom behaviors/domains, custom providers/"
"models, gesture registrations, chat history."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2835
msgid "Quick: Fresh start"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2836
msgid ""
"Resets everything except API keys and chat history:\n"
"• All settings (provider, model, temperature, all toggles)\n"
"• All actions (custom, edits, menus, the + Gesture Menu list)\n"
"• Custom behaviors & domains\n"
"• Custom providers & models\n"
"\n"
"Keeps: API keys, your languages, gesture registrations, chat history only. "
"Offers the Setup Wizard when it is done."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2838
msgid ""
"Fresh start?\n"
"\n"
"Resets:\n"
"• All settings (provider, model, temperature, all toggles)\n"
"• All actions (custom, edits, menus, the + Gesture Menu list)\n"
"• Custom behaviors & domains\n"
"• Custom providers & models\n"
"\n"
"Keeps: API keys, your languages, gesture registrations, chat history only.\n"
"\n"
"The Setup Wizard is offered when it is done."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2846
msgid "Custom reset..."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2847
msgid ""
"Opens a checklist to choose exactly what to reset:\n"
"• Settings (all toggles and preferences)\n"
"• Custom actions\n"
"• Action edits\n"
"• Action menus\n"
"• Custom providers & models\n"
"• Behaviors & domains\n"
"• API keys (with warning)"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2855
msgid "Clear all chat history"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:2856
